# ansible-bootstrap

* Modular playbooks share `playbook_package-managers.yml`. Follow existing `playbook_*.yml` / vars package structure.
* Typical apply (user runs): `ansible-pull -U https://github.com/mrbasa/ansible-bootstrap.git <playbook> -K -l localhost`
* **`ansible-pull` checkout is not this folder.** Pull clones/updates `~/.ansible/pull/<hostname>/` (e.g. `~/.ansible/pull/Zephyr`). Edit and commit in this Projects clone; pull will fetch from GitHub into its own directory.
* Multi-distro (Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora/RHEL, Arch). Prefer idempotent tasks; package failures may continue with logging to `~/ansible_package_failures.log`.
* **Do not** store lab Podman secrets, PBS keys, or cloud API tokens in this repo. Homelab compose lives in `basa-homelab`.
* Dotfiles / Chezmoi: separate [dotfiles](https://github.com/MrBasa/dotfiles) repo; this repo installs tools, Chezmoi manages dotfiles.
* Agent: edit playbooks here; user runs ansible-pull unless they explicitly ask the agent to run a local command.
